sequenceDiagram
  actor Op as Operator
  participant W as wrapper.mjs
  participant FS as data/requests/UUID
  participant PS as private-output.ps1
  participant P as Provider CLI

  Op->>W: send request.json
  W->>W: validate fields, model, scope
  W->>P: read-only subscription preflight
  P-->>W: existing login confirmed
  W->>FS: mkdir UUID (atomic reservation)
  opt captureResult is true
    W->>PS: restrict folder ACL
    PS-->>W: private true
  end
  W->>FS: status.json (unknown / started)
  W->>P: prompt on stdin (timeout, 2 MiB cap)
  P-->>W: JSON or NDJSON result
  W->>W: classify state
  W->>FS: status.json (final state)
  opt executed or verified with capture
    W->>FS: result.json + SHA-256
  end
  W-->>Op: metadata, exit 0 / 1 / 2
  Op->>W: read-result UUID
  W->>FS: read result.json
  W-->>Op: response after hash check
